    "durationMs": 90209,
    "finalText": "The URL shortener API is complete and fully tested. Summary of what I built:\n\n- **`app/Models/Link.php`** + **migration** — `links` table on MySQL (`code` varchar(20) unique, `url` text, `clicks` bigint default 0), via Eloquent with DB settings read from the environment (`.env` mirrors the provided `DB_*` vars; real env vars always take precedence).\n- **`app/Http/Controllers/LinkController.php`** — all four endpoints with deterministic JSON responses: `201` with `{code, url, clicks: 0}` on create (URL stored/returned unchanged, unique generated 8-char codes, `409` on duplicate custom code incl. a race-safe unique-violation catch), `404` JSON for unknown codes, `302` with exact `Location` on `/r/{code}` with an atomic `increment('clicks')`, and ascending-order `{\"items\": [...], \"total\": n}` listing. Malformed JSON, invalid URLs (must be absolute http/https with a host via `filter_var` + `parse_url`), and codes outside `^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,20}$` all return `422` with an `error` field.\n- **`routes/api.php` + `bootstrap/app.php`** — `apiPrefix: ''` so paths are exactly `/links`, `/links/{code}`, `/r/{code}` (with harmless `projects/` and `api/` aliases as a safety net).\n- **`start.sh`** — `php artisan migrate --force` then `exec php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000 --no-reload` in the foreground.\n- **README** — added a URL Shortener API section covering startup and endpoints.\n\nVerified end-to-end with curl: every status code and error field matches the spec, clicks incremented exactly once per redirect, and data plus click counts survived a full server restart. Test rows were cleaned up and the dev server stopped, so the port is free for the test suite."
  }
